--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The native addon in bin/ is a Rust library. Every decoder in it is pure Rust,
with no C library or system dependency. The crates linked into it are listed
below with the license each is published under. Where a crate offers a choice,
the choice is the user's.

